# Pinned developer tools: one line per release archive, oldest version first.
#
#   tool version target sha256 url
#
# tools/gate/dev-tools.sh checks each tool's version and builds it from crates.io
# on install; .agents/setup installs the Linux archives (for jj, the newest);
# tools/dev/jj-tools.py installs every jj line for its platform; the musl image
# recipe reads the cargo-nextest, cargo-deny and ruff versions.
